<!-- ============ SECTION 2 · KEY INSIGHT — THE FIVE-DOCUMENT ARC ============ -->
<tr>
<td style="padding:32px 36px; border-bottom:1px solid #E8E8E8;">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:22px; font-weight:900; color:#232F3E; letter-spacing:-0.3px; line-height:1.3; font-family:Calibri, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">The five-document arc nobody read end-to-end</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#232F3E;">Five PMPG publications in five months. Read individually, each is a tactical update. Read in sequence, they describe a structural shift in who owns the November 2026 cutover.</p>

