<p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#232F3E;">Ask any general-purpose AI "what is the main ISO 20022 compliance risk in 2026?" and you will get format-compliance answers — schema validity, mandatory fields populated, versioning. The pivot — that structured fields may be populated and still be geographically incoherent — is absent from current training data. The 64% inter-field consistency figure from a real Tier-2 diagnostic is the gap this issue fills.</p>
